{"id":"733785fa2bb6eb61","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction.md","title":"Theorem — 自由代数与遗忘函子的显式伴随","display":"Theorem — 自由代数与遗忘函子的显式伴随","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction","aliases":["14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction"],"display":"Theorem — 自由代数与遗忘函子的显式伴随","source_ref":"IV.4, printed 177–178; DjVu 94–95","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-monad]]","[[14-df-monad-algebras]]","[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","[[14-df-identity-composite-functors]]","[[14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering]]","[[14-df-isomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 自由代数与遗忘函子的显式伴随"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"IV.4, printed 177–178; DjVu 94–95"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"61a5bbf642ba9c20\" href=\"?note=61a5bbf642ba9c20\" title=\"14-df-monad\">14-df-monad</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e28e85ec3a8dde78\" href=\"?note=e28e85ec3a8dde78\" title=\"14-df-monad-algebras\">14-df-monad-algebras</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dad26c5de724390a\" href=\"?note=dad26c5de724390a\" title=\"14-df-identity-composite-functors\">14-df-identity-composite-functors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f012515fd4cf0061\" href=\"?note=f012515fd4cf0061\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering\">14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,\\eta,\\mu)\">\\((T,\\eta,\\mu)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 上的单子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C^T,F_T,U_T,\\beta_T\">\\(\\mathcal C^T,F_T,U_T,\\beta_T\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e28e85ec3a8dde78\" href=\"?note=e28e85ec3a8dde78\" title=\"14-df-monad-algebras\">14-df-monad-algebras</a> 的完整带标签编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 的对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=(B,b)\">\\(K=(B,b)\\)</span> 遍历代数对象；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e^T_K\">\\(e^T_K\\)</span> 是下式构造的代数箭头。自然变换三元组、恒等/复合与伴随见所列内部依赖。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsIso}_{\\mathcal A}\">\\(\\operatorname{IsIso}_{\\mathcal A}\\)</span> 表示将 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a> 的环境范畴指定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C^T),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(F_T,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C^T),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(U_T,\\mathcal C^T,\\mathcal C),\\qquad U_T\\circ F_T=T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C^T),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(F_T,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C^T),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(U_T,\\mathcal C^T,\\mathcal C),\\qquad U_T\\circ F_T=T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"e^T_{(B,b)}\\coloneqq(F_T(B),(B,b),b),\\qquad\n\\eta^T\\coloneqq(1_{\\mathcal C},U_T\\circ F_T,(\\eta_A)_{A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}),\\qquad\ne^T\\coloneqq(F_T\\circ U_T,1_{\\mathcal C^T},(e^T_K)_{K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C^T)}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[e^T_{(B,b)}\\coloneqq(F_T(B),(B,b),b),\\qquad\n\\eta^T\\coloneqq(1_{\\mathcal C},U_T\\circ F_T,(\\eta_A)_{A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}),\\qquad\ne^T\\coloneqq(F_T\\circ U_T,1_{\\mathcal C^T},(e^T_K)_{K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C^T)}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsNatural}(\\eta^T,1_{\\mathcal C},U_T\\circ F_T),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsNatural}(e^T,F_T\\circ U_T,1_{\\mathcal C^T}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsNatural}(\\eta^T,1_{\\mathcal C},U_T\\circ F_T),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsNatural}(e^T,F_T\\circ U_T,1_{\\mathcal C^T}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\quad e^T_{F_T(A)}\\circ F_T(\\eta_A)=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal C^T}(F_T(A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\quad e^T_{F_T(A)}\\circ F_T(\\eta_A)=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal C^T}(F_T(A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C^T)\\quad U_T(e^T_K)\\circ\\eta_{U_T(K)}=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal C}(U_T(K)),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsAdjunction}(F_T,U_T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C^T)\\quad U_T(e^T_K)\\circ\\eta_{U_T(K)}=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal C}(U_T(K)),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsAdjunction}(F_T,U_T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall K,L\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C^T)\\ \\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(K,L)\\quad\n\\operatorname{IsIso}_{\\mathcal C}(U_T(u))\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{IsIso}_{\\mathcal C^T}(u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall K,L\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C^T)\\ \\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(K,L)\\quad\n\\operatorname{IsIso}_{\\mathcal C}(U_T(u))\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{IsIso}_{\\mathcal C^T}(u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 IV.4 在印刷177–178（DjVu94–95）给出自由/遗忘伴随。本条将已有<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e28e85ec3a8dde78\" href=\"?note=e28e85ec3a8dde78\" title=\"14-df-monad-algebras\">14-df-monad-algebras</a>的 Hom 双射补成自然单位、余单位和三角式，并补后文实际使用的反映同构性质。</p>\n<p>首先，代数恒等箭头满足交换式；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"fa=bT(f)\">\\(fa=bT(f)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"gb=cT(g)\">\\(gb=cT(g)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(gf)a=cT(gf)\">\\((gf)a=cT(gf)\\)</span>，故<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"e28e85ec3a8dde78\" href=\"?note=e28e85ec3a8dde78\" title=\"14-df-monad-algebras\">14-df-monad-algebras</a>的六元组确为范畴。单子结合律及单位律使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(TA,\\mu_A)\">\\((TA,\\mu_A)\\)</span> 为代数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 自然性使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(f)\">\\(T(f)\\)</span> 为代数态射，故两个给定映射为函子，且遗忘自由函子的复合严格为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b:T B\\to B\">\\(b:T B\\to B\\)</span> 是从自由代数到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(B,b)\">\\((B,b)\\)</span> 的代数态射，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\mu_B=bT(b)\">\\(b\\mu_B=bT(b)\\)</span>。其自然性恰为代数态射方程：对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u=(K,L,f)\">\\(u=(K,L,f)\\)</span>，两边的底层箭头分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"fb\">\\(fb\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"cT(f)\">\\(cT(f)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta^T\">\\(\\eta^T\\)</span> 的自然性就是单子单位的自然性。第一条三角式的底层箭头为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_A T(\\eta_A)=1_{TA}\">\\(\\mu_A T(\\eta_A)=1_{TA}\\)</span>；第二条为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\eta_B=1_B\">\\(b\\eta_B=1_B\\)</span>。带标签箭头相等由共同源靶及底层箭头相等决定，所以得到<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a>的伴随条件。已有<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"e28e85ec3a8dde78\" href=\"?note=e28e85ec3a8dde78\" title=\"14-df-monad-algebras\">14-df-monad-algebras</a>的双射也因此对两个变量自然。</p>\n<p>最后，设代数态射的底层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:A\\to B\">\\(f:A\\to B\\)</span> 可逆，逆为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:B\\to A\">\\(g:B\\to A\\)</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"fa=bT(f)\">\\(fa=bT(f)\\)</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"aT(g)=gb\">\\(aT(g)=gb\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(L,K,g)\">\\((L,K,g)\\)</span> 是反向代数态射。两复合的底层为恒等，且代数标签对应，故它确是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的逆。反映同构不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 保持任何极限或余极限。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-monad","status":"resolved","id":"61a5bbf642ba9c20","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-monad]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-monad-algebras","status":"resolved","id":"e28e85ec3a8dde78","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-monad-algebras]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"1bdaf4a293143165","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-identity-composite-functors","status":"resolved","id":"dad26c5de724390a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-identity-composite-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering","status":"resolved","id":"f012515fd4cf0061","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-transformation-composition-whiskering]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"d5f547b903550705","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-monad-algebras","status":"resolved","id":"e28e85ec3a8dde78","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(T,\\eta,\\mu)$ 是 $\\mathcal C$ 上的单子。$\\mathcal C^T,F_T,U_T,\\beta_T$ 取 [[14-df-monad-algebras]] 的完整带标签编码。$A$ 遍历 $\\mathcal C$ 的对象，$K=(B,b)$ 遍历代数对象；$e^T_K$ 是下式构造的代数箭头。自然变换三元组、恒等/复合与伴随见所列内部依赖。$\\operatorname{IsIso}_{\\mathcal A}$ 表示将 [[14-df-isomorphism]] 的环境范畴指定为 $\\mathcal A$。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"d5f547b903550705","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(T,\\eta,\\mu)$ 是 $\\mathcal C$ 上的单子。$\\mathcal C^T,F_T,U_T,\\beta_T$ 取 [[14-df-monad-algebras]] 的完整带标签编码。$A$ 遍历 $\\mathcal C$ 的对象，$K=(B,b)$ 遍历代数对象；$e^T_K$ 是下式构造的代数箭头。自然变换三元组、恒等/复合与伴随见所列内部依赖。$\\operatorname{IsIso}_{\\mathcal A}$ 表示将 [[14-df-isomorphism]] 的环境范畴指定为 $\\mathcal A$。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-monad-algebras","status":"resolved","id":"e28e85ec3a8dde78","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 IV.4 在印刷177–178（DjVu94–95）给出自由/遗忘伴随。本条将已有[[14-df-monad-algebras]]的 Hom 双射补成自然单位、余单位和三角式，并补后文实际使用的反映同构性质。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-monad-algebras","status":"resolved","id":"e28e85ec3a8dde78","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"首先，代数恒等箭头满足交换式；若 $fa=bT(f)$、$gb=cT(g)$，则 $(gf)a=cT(gf)$，故[[14-df-monad-algebras]]的六元组确为范畴。单子结合律及单位律使 $(TA,\\mu_A)$ 为代数，$\\mu$ 自然性使 $T(f)$ 为代数态射，故两个给定映射为函子，且遗忘自由函子的复合严格为 $T$。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$b:T B\\to B$ 是从自由代数到 $(B,b)$ 的代数态射，因为 $b\\mu_B=bT(b)$。其自然性恰为代数态射方程：对 $u=(K,L,f)$，两边的底层箭头分别为 $fb$ 与 $cT(f)$。$\\eta^T$ 的自然性就是单子单位的自然性。第一条三角式的底层箭头为 $\\mu_A T(\\eta_A)=1_{TA}$；第二条为 $b\\eta_B=1_B$。带标签箭头相等由共同源靶及底层箭头相等决定，所以得到[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]的伴随条件。已有[[14-df-monad-algebras]]的双射也因此对两个变量自然。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-monad-algebras","status":"resolved","id":"e28e85ec3a8dde78","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$b:T B\\to B$ 是从自由代数到 $(B,b)$ 的代数态射，因为 $b\\mu_B=bT(b)$。其自然性恰为代数态射方程：对 $u=(K,L,f)$，两边的底层箭头分别为 $fb$ 与 $cT(f)$。$\\eta^T$ 的自然性就是单子单位的自然性。第一条三角式的底层箭头为 $\\mu_A T(\\eta_A)=1_{TA}$；第二条为 $b\\eta_B=1_B$。带标签箭头相等由共同源靶及底层箭头相等决定，所以得到[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]的伴随条件。已有[[14-df-monad-algebras]]的双射也因此对两个变量自然。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(T,\\eta,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C^T,F_T,U_T,\\beta_T","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"K=(B,b)","display":false},{"tex":"e^T_K","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsIso}_{\\mathcal A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C^T),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(F_T,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C^T),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(U_T,\\mathcal C^T,\\mathcal C),\\qquad U_T\\circ F_T=T.","display":true},{"tex":"e^T_{(B,b)}\\coloneqq(F_T(B),(B,b),b),\\qquad\n\\eta^T\\coloneqq(1_{\\mathcal C},U_T\\circ F_T,(\\eta_A)_{A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}),\\qquad\ne^T\\coloneqq(F_T\\circ U_T,1_{\\mathcal C^T},(e^T_K)_{K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C^T)}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsNatural}(\\eta^T,1_{\\mathcal C},U_T\\circ F_T),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsNatural}(e^T,F_T\\circ U_T,1_{\\mathcal C^T}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\quad e^T_{F_T(A)}\\circ F_T(\\eta_A)=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal C^T}(F_T(A)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall K\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C^T)\\quad U_T(e^T_K)\\circ\\eta_{U_T(K)}=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal C}(U_T(K)),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsAdjunction}(F_T,U_T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall K,L\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C^T)\\ \\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C^T}(K,L)\\quad\n\\operatorname{IsIso}_{\\mathcal C}(U_T(u))\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{IsIso}_{\\mathcal C^T}(u).","display":true},{"tex":"fa=bT(f)","display":false},{"tex":"gb=cT(g)","display":false},{"tex":"(gf)a=cT(gf)","display":false},{"tex":"(TA,\\mu_A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"T(f)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"b:T B\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"(B,b)","display":false},{"tex":"b\\mu_B=bT(b)","display":false},{"tex":"u=(K,L,f)","display":false},{"tex":"fb","display":false},{"tex":"cT(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta^T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_A T(\\eta_A)=1_{TA}","display":false},{"tex":"b\\eta_B=1_B","display":false},{"tex":"f:A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"g:B\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"fa=bT(f)","display":false},{"tex":"aT(g)=gb","display":false},{"tex":"(L,K,g)","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":3690,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-315","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction|Theorem — 自由代数与遗忘函子的显式伴随]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-138","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-295","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction]]"},{"id":"e28e85ec3a8dde78","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"单子结合律、单位律说明 $F_TA$ 确为代数；$\\mu$ 的自然性使 $T(f)$ 为代数态射。代数态射的恒等和复合满足同一交换关系。最后两个映射互逆：一个方向用 $b\\eta=1$ 与 $\\eta$ 自然性，另一个方向用代数态射关系及 $\\mu_A T\\eta_A=1$。显式自然单位、余单位及三角式另由 [[14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction]] 给出，所以 $F_T\\dashv U_T$，并非只定义了对象集合而遗漏范畴态射。"},{"id":"552e996c15863488","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-217","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction]]"},{"id":"a847472bc37dd64a","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-316","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction|Theorem — 自由代数与遗忘函子的显式伴随]]"},{"id":"f1b3afad9b25fc1d","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"这个 $i$ 正是单位的底层箭头。确实，由 $Gq_K\\mu_A=Gq_KT(a)$ 预合成 $\\eta_{TA}$，用单位律及自然性得 $Gq_K=Gq_K\\eta_Aa$，所以 $i=Gq_K\\eta_A$。[[14-thm-beck-comparison-left-adjoint]]已经证明它是代数态射；[[14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction]]的遗忘函子反映同构，故 $\\lambda_K$ 在代数范畴可逆。注意此步骤没有使用 $G$ 反映同构。"},{"id":"4f584a450845e8d6","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本轮已将此路线使用的自由/遗忘伴随、比较函子、分裂余等化子和强 Beck 充分判据展开为 [[14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction]]、[[14-df-monadic-adjunction]]、[[14-df-split-coequalizer]]、[[14-thm-free-algebra-coequalizer]]、[[14-thm-beck-comparison-left-adjoint]]、[[14-thm-beck-monadicity]]。它们为该证明提供具体的单子工具；本条仍未展开 IV.5 幂对象反变函子的单子性与其所需余等化保持验证，不能仅凭新增的一般判据就宣称这条有限余极限证明已经完整重建。此段为证明路线导航，Assertion与直接定义依赖未变。"},{"id":"34c430417768f1a0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$(T,\\eta,\\mu)$ 是 $\\mathcal C$ 上单子，$K=(A,a)$ 为 $T$ 代数。使用[[14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction]]的自由函子和[[14-df-monad-algebras]]的带标签箭头。余等化、反身对及分裂余等化的参数顺序见 [[14-df-split-coequalizer]]；这里的分裂数据在底层范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 中，不预设它们都是代数态射。"}],"outgoing":["61a5bbf642ba9c20","e28e85ec3a8dde78","1bdaf4a293143165","d2b4e5cf16585f95","dad26c5de724390a","f012515fd4cf0061","d5f547b903550705"]}